  "description": {
    "text": "Korean League 2015 began on 6 December 2014 with preliminaries running until its Champion final on 28 March 2015, and every participant received a promo pack holding one random card. Packs 1 to 4 held 018-026, 030-039, 040-047 and 059-062 and 064-067/XY-P, and in 2015 the packs could also be exchanged for players' points."
